  Docs\LEVEL1.md:77:| `marcus_collapse` | The wall falls | Marcus | Three turns, as in `VOICE.md` |
  Docs\LEVEL1.md:78:| `arg_back_pipe_stopped` | Backfill catches a stopped pipe crew | Dana, Marcus | Four turns, as 
